<title>POLAND: SWARZEDZ AT PLN 3 MLN LOSS IN JUNE.</title>
<headline>SWARZEDZ AT PLN 3 MLN LOSS IN JUNE.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results June</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> JUNE		     1997     1996</p>
<p> Net loss		 3.04 vs   1.41</p>
<p> Pre-tax loss	   3.04 vs   1.41</p>
<p> Operating loss	 1.60 vs   0.52</p>
<p> Sales		   10.73 vs   8.31</p>
<p> JANUARY-JUNE	   1997     1996</p>
<p> Net loss		 4.58 vs   3.13</p>
<p> Pre-tax loss	   4.58 vs   3.13</p>
<p> Operating profit     1.59 vs   3.18</p>
<p> Sales		   63.79 vs  49.39</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish furniture maker is Swarzedzkie</p>
<p>Fabryki Mebli SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
